      "name": "Step 2: Embrace transformable furniture: This is the cornerstone of adaptab…",
      "text": "Embrace transformable furniture: This is the cornerstone of adaptable design. Think about a sofa that converts into a bed, a dining table that folds down from a wall or extends from an island, or even modular seating that can be reconfigured. Every piece should be able to shift roles. What it looks like done: furniture pieces are selected that offer at least two distinct functions."
    },
